00:03:04.051 --> 00:03:08.622 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car elle est la clé de

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:09.857 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la conquête du port d'Odessaau r

00:03:07.721 --> 00:03:11.091 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Noire, le joyau et le poumon

